# FE product UX

Adapted from [Toss-style DS](https://github.com/PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules) + `fe/DESIGN.md`. **Not** a second token layer — use `--background`, `--foreground`, `--muted`, `--primary`, `--destructive`.

## Hierarchy

- One accent (`text-primary` / `bg-primary`) for primary actions and **clickable table values**
- Status only via semantic tokens (`destructive`, success/warning badges) — never color alone
- No nested cards, no extra hex colors, no decorative gradients on admin screens

## Every interactive surface

Must have **loading, empty, error, hover, focus**. Lists that hit a paginated API must show pager (prev/next or `DataTable` `serverPaging`).

## Copy

- Visible `<Label>` on inputs (never placeholder-only)
- User-visible strings via i18n (`t()`), including toasts and pagination
- Focus visible; tap targets padded; honor `prefers-reduced-motion`

## Spacing

Admin pages: outer `flex flex-1 flex-col gap-4 p-4`. Do not invent a second page shell.
